~ traveller_start
Traveler: Hello, little one! I’ve traveled to many countries and seen people from different places helping each other and working hard together. This road is called the 
	Path of Humanity. [#hint=Understand the core of the Path of Humanity]
- That sounds really interesting! I want to hear more about it!
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("traveller_start", "curious", "curious")
	Traveler: I’m glad you are interested! The Path of Humanity is not about saving others. You only need to see, listen, and cooperate. That is the Path of Humanity.
- So are we supposed to go help other people?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("traveller_start", "helping", "empathetic")
	Traveler: Helping is okay, but not as a savior. You only need to see, listen, and cooperate. That is the Path of Humanity.
- Do people from all over the world help one another?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("traveller_start", "cooperation", "action")
	Traveler: Yes, that is the meaning of this path. You do not need to save anyone. You only need to see, listen, and cooperate. That is the Path of Humanity.
You: I understand! I want to step onto the Path of Humanity too!
Traveler: Wonderful! Remember your mission: Observe more, listen more, help more, and do not take the lead. [#hint=Keep in mind the identity of an assistant]
do QuestState.mark_chapter0_traveler_done()
=> END

~ family_start
Family: Child, we support you to explore and learn! [#hint=Get family encouragement and support]
- I will carefully observe everything that happens along the journey!
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("family_start", "observe", "curious")
	Family: That’s wonderful! Remember, respect everyone, help with every little thing, and bring warmth back.
- I feel a little nervous, but I’m willing to give it a try.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("family_start", "nervous", "empathetic")
	Family: Don’t be afraid, just be brave. Remember, respect everyone, help with every little thing, and bring warmth back.
- May I share my stories with everyone after I come back?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("family_start", "share", "action")
	Family: Of course you can! But while you travel, please remember, respect everyone, help with every little thing, and bring warmth back.
Player: I will surely remember!
do QuestState.mark_chapter0_family_done()
=> END

~ friend_start
Adele: You’re leaving! That’s so cool![#hint=Get peer support]
- I will collect lots of interesting stories to bring back!
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("friend_start", "stories", "curious")
	Adele: Wow, I can’t wait to hear them! When you come back, I want you to tell me all your stories along the way!
- I will try my best to help people I meet on my journey.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("friend_start", "help", "empathetic")
	Adele: I’m so proud of you! When you come back, I want you to tell me all your stories along the way!
- I will miss this place a little bit.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("friend_start", "miss", "action")
	Adele: I will miss you too! Don’t worry. When you come back, I want you to tell me all your stories along the way!
Player: When I come back, I’ll tell you stories along the way!
Adele: Okay! I’ll wait for you!
do QuestState.mark_chapter0_friend_done()
=> END

~ maggie_start
Maggie: Water has been getting less and less recently, not even enough for watering the fields. [#hint=Record the problem of reduced water volume]
- What crops are you growing in the fields?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("maggie_start", "crops", "curious")
	Maggie: They are our main food crops, and they cannot survive without enough water. Water has been getting less and less recently, not even enough for watering the fields.
- It must be really hard when there is not enough water for your crops.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("maggie_start", "hardship", "empathetic")
	Maggie: Yes, all villagers are worried about this. Water has been getting less and less recently, not even enough for watering the fields.
- Shall I write down your trouble so more people know about it?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("maggie_start", "record", "action")
	Maggie: That would be helpful for solving our problem. Water has been getting less and less recently, not even enough for watering the fields.
do QuestState.mark_quest1_maggie_done()
=> END

~ kai_start
Kai: The canal is blocked, and water can’t flow to my fields. [#hint=Record the problem of canal blockage]
- How far away is the blocked section from here?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("kai_start", "distance", "curious")
	Kai: It is not far upstream. The canal is blocked, and water can’t flow to my fields.
- Your crops will dry out without water arriving. You must be anxious.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("kai_start", "anxiety", "empathetic")
	Kai: I keep worrying about my farmland every day. The canal is blocked, and water can’t flow to my fields.
- Maybe we can go and check the blocked canal together.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("kai_start", "inspect", "action")
	Kai: Someone really needs to take a look at that spot. The canal is blocked, and water can’t flow to my fields.
do QuestState.mark_quest1_kai_done()
=> END

~ jessica_start
Jessica: Sometimes there’s no water during the day; it’s so inconvenient.[#hint=Record the problem of uneven water use and life difficulties]
- At what time can you usually get running water?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("jessica_start", "schedule", "curious")
	Jessica: We cannot predict, it changes every day. Sometimes there’s no water during the day; it’s so inconvenient.
- Daily life will be tough without tap-in water.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("jessica_start", "hardship", "empathetic")
	Jessica: Exactly. Cooking and washing all become difficult. Sometimes there’s no water during the day; it’s so inconvenient.
- I will note this living difficulty down in my notebook.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("jessica_start", "record", "action")
	Jessica: Hope our situation can be noticed by everyone. Sometimes there’s no water during the day; it’s so inconvenient.
do QuestState.mark_quest1_jessica_done()
=> END

