# ===== Chapter 1 easter egg & medal content (Qingxi Valley 2.0) =====

~ stone_start
Stone beside stream: Many villagers sit here and talk about water-saving ideas.
- What useful ideas have they talked about?
	Stone beside stream: Collecting rainwater, repairing ditches and planting water-retaining plants. Small ideas bring big changes.
- It's nice that villagers think together for the valley.
	Stone beside stream: When everyone shares thoughts, it is easier to solve hard problems.
- I also want to think of more ways to save water.
	Stone beside stream: Keep observing life, and you will find lots of simple water-saving tips.
do QuestState.mark_stone_chat_done()
=> END

~ sign_start
Wooden sign: Remind everyone to take good care of the valley water system.
- Who made this wooden sign?
	Wooden sign: It was made by local villagers together. Everyone hopes to protect the clean water source.
- Protecting water needs reminding all the time.
	Wooden sign: That's right. Protection is not only one-time work, but long-term persistence.
- I will also remember to protect the water system.
	Wooden sign: Your promise is also part of guarding this valley.
do QuestState.mark_sign_chat_done()
=> END

~ arden_watersort_start
Arden: You have finished the water-sorting mini-game. Good job observing what pollutes water.
- What rubbish harms the stream most?
	Arden: Man-made rubbish will pollute water for a long time. Natural fallen leaves can decompose in nature.
- It is troublesome when rubbish gets into the water.
	Arden: Yes, so we need to stop rubbish from flowing into the water source in advance.
- I will pay attention not to let rubbish get into streams.
	Arden: Very good. Small observation can help us better protect water resources.
do QuestState.mark_minigame_watersort_done()
=> END

~ arden_medal_start
Arden: You have finished all the important things in Qingxi Valley. Please take this medal as encouragement for your journey on the Path of Humanity.
- Will I get similar medals in other villages?
	Arden: Yes. Every place has its own stories and tests waiting for you.
- I feel happy to help the villagers here.
	Arden: Happiness comes from understanding and accompanying others. That is the spirit of the Path of Humanity.
- I will keep trying my best on the following journey.
	Arden: Go ahead. Keep seeing, listening and cooperating along your way.
do QuestState.mark_chapter1_medal_arden_done()
=> END

~ villagers_start
- Shall I tell every household one‑by‑one about the village meeting?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("villagers_start", "households", "curious")
- Many villagers are troubled by water. It’s good for everyone to talk together.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("villagers_start", "talk", "empathetic")
- I will tell all villagers to come to the village entrance for the water‑use meeting this afternoon.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("villagers_start", "announce", "action")
Player: Grandpa Arden, uncles and aunts, we will hold a council meeting at the village entrance this afternoon to discuss the water use issue. Everyone remember to come! [#hint=Notify villagers to attend the meeting]
Villagers: Okay! We will definitely come!
do QuestState.mark_quest3_complete()
=> END

