- What kinds of rubbish do we need to pick up?
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("jessica_ch2_start", "rubbish", "curious")
	Jessica: Plastic and foam are everywhere. Pick up every piece you see, then sort each item into the right bag.
- The dirty beach makes me feel sad.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("jessica_ch2_start", "sad", "empathetic")
	Jessica: Many sea animals get hurt by rubbish. Pick up every piece you see, then sort each item into the right bag.
- Let's get our gloves and garbage bags ready.
	do DialogueChoices.record_choice("jessica_ch2_start", "prepare", "action")
	Jessica: Perfect! Pick up every piece you see, then sort each item into the right bag.
Player: I'll collect the trash on the beach and sort it properly.
Jessica: Great! Pick up every piece you see, then sort each item into the right bag.
do QuestState.mark_chapter2_beach_cleanup_started()
=> END

